{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18123","headline":"与张十八同效阮步兵一日复一夕 · 韩愈","name":"与张十八同效阮步兵一日复一夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一日复一日，一朝复一朝。\n秖见有不如，不见有所超。\n食作前日味，事作前日调。\n不知久不死，悯悯尚谁要。\n富贵自絷拘，贫贱亦煎焦。\n俯仰未得所，一世已解镳。\n譬如笼中鹤，六翮无所摇。\n譬如兔得蹄，安用东西跳。\n还看古人书，复举前人瓢。\n未知所究竟，且作新诗谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}